                <divLine xml:id="m-0af08564-507c-4232-bb61-6ef538f5b5e8" facs="#m-35f59d53-4184-40c3-ba77-2bd764e4912b" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-9a47f7c3-87e5-4fba-86b6-5f932c46cadf">
              <lg xml:id="m-ef85a172-2e32-488e-839b-110e2a55698b">
                <l xml:id="m-522b45e7-8b5a-457c-ad35-b5aeb37cc75c" facs="#m-97aca886-c251-4fb5-a58c-63de18f5049f" label="text-like">Mass for the Propagation of the Faith.</l><l xml:id="m-826e7ed0-d3d4-4b39-898b-176db8a4f3c8" facs="#m-1914f396-d826-4ca1-97e8-3ce542c04c0f" label="ambiguous">1293</l><l xml:id="m-3c630a46-76d9-4dd8-9704-950e68f0c2da" facs="#m-2a62cf2e-92a8-4d2f-879f-b044efc90e59" label="lyrics-like">bis : illúminet vúltum sú-um super nos,</l><l xml:id="m-c2476e57-f398-4f6e-9fad-4b932bcfc089" facs="#m-b940c37f-f7ef-4b86-b3c0-8b29917990db" label="ambiguous">et mi-se¬</l><l xml:id="m-7df6a95a-4372-42fb-aace-3ebd856ebd86" facs="#m-59145b6a-9b5d-498d-bcff-178c5f17b34d" label="lyrics-like">re-átur nó- stri:</l><l xml:id="m-ddc50d42-00ba-455e-99ee-7f055e18158e" facs="#m-441cc1e4-514d-4cd0-9a7e-73c7c9748ff1" label="lyrics-like">ut cognoscá- mus in tér-ra ví-am</l><l xml:id="m-81c9c041-ba41-4f65-b8da-b96e4ebfda71" facs="#m-d0ba65ba-b9ed-49ad-889f-57720baf2f52" label="lyrics-like">tú- am, in ómni-bus géntibus sa-lutá¬</l><l xml:id="m-d406bab0-6595-4170-b8ec-c1cce87758c1" facs="#m-d765e566-8a35-4db5-9439-78d645710640" label="lyrics-like">re tú¬ um.</l><l xml:id="m-4aa82ca2-fd1b-4f36-8d5f-2c167580c8b6" facs="#m-2fefd729-6c4c-4ac0-86af-197971c83035" label="lyrics-like">Ps. Confi-te-ántur tí-bi pópu-li, Dé-us: * confi-te-ántur tí¬</l><l xml:id="m-2f890c9a-6091-4ca8-ac81-1fc1fc42aba6" facs="#m-4aece60e-422f-4ab7-af59-4f41a43f2653" label="lyrics-like">bi pó- pu-li ómnes. Gló-ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-7ffb6567-2f8d-4c17-8755-07f5f900e728" facs="#m-2301692b-5639-4582-be77-066c94c0b00e" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-716eeeed-ba21-4427-a965-b5fc5ac67b77" facs="#m-3729b26b-19ea-4e3e-8044-81a9820edf05" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui omnes hómines vis sal-] rificétur, et omnes gentes cognó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0e8fd63d-1b3c-4cfe-8e01-eb4404a8618f" facs="#m-8418a249-23e8-4c2f-82c8-8c624fe018a6" label="ambiguous">scant te solum Deum verum, et</l><l xml:id="m-428993de-a454-4a02-9d46-daf4fa2a7cb4" facs="#m-08d0dc44-855f-4673-84e9-0af785c4cef9" label="lyrics-like">A vos fieri, et ad agnitiónem ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-c95153f5-e02b-49da-8025-345e8aa218eb" facs="#m-b205d5d0-36df-4012-b19a-98592ae55dab" label="lyrics-like">quem misísti Jesum Christum Fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ef3484b-80be-4f89-a904-945827c5d343" facs="#m-55f5057c-84c4-4815-8b8f-032950d189cd" label="lyrics-like">ritátis venire: mitte, quaésumus,</l><l xml:id="m-abf69b98-e585-499c-8806-6af239351e18" facs="#m-ce2c7fb1-ed95-469e-862c-3efe1916a048" label="lyrics-like">lium tuum, Dóminum nostrum. Qui</l><l xml:id="m-2d5cff3d-a28f-4d1f-814b-4d61a1e2e977" facs="#m-09b0b75e-6928-4196-83a8-94ca7d3a3761" label="lyrics-like">operários in messem tuam, et da</l><l xml:id="m-5e07ff1c-88ca-4805-8e69-f66c2fc9dad1" facs="#m-841b50f2-33f3-4bc4-9bc8-515976bee7da" label="lyrics-like">eis cum omni fidúcia loqui verbum</l><l xml:id="m-aa6caef4-e9ce-4603-ade1-c821a6fe735d" facs="#m-a2a0ee3f-3904-4830-8d7b-03ce4f38a852" label="ambiguous">tecum vivit.</l><l xml:id="m-8e0cdc35-f4bf-4531-8dfc-91b0803ee497" facs="#m-10b1f588-27a8-4d4e-a2eb-4f5376309193" label="ambiguous">tuum; ut sermo tuus currat et cla¬</l><l xml:id="m-d0621cb6-4649-4135-b574-55fa7b2533c0" facs="#m-0ec62f62-430f-41b6-915f-b2d02cc84a53" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Sapientiae. Eccli. 36.</l><l xml:id="m-c4e89379-34b8-4abd-9ab5-7a2ef9a862d9" facs="#m-a4aaa343-25f3-44bd-84a9-7842bada2366" label="lyrics-like">Iserére nostri, Deus ómnium, et bráchium dextrum. Excita furó¬</l><l xml:id="m-5df8284d-5d8e-45ff-aef6-36be82492936" facs="#m-3d6ffa9c-9ba7-4de7-87a7-862771dc9165" label="lyrics-like">1L et réspice nos, et osténde no¬</l><l xml:id="m-cfd2df94-8bd9-4555-bd1b-8acf3feec34b" facs="#m-0c1b7982-a62f-42a0-9b4f-44d02157aa37" label="lyrics-like">rem, et effúnde iram. Tolle adver¬</l><l xml:id="m-7526bf22-b558-429e-9516-da286dfbf247" facs="#m-1cfec7d2-d991-4adc-b801-513e7f1f3d4a" label="lyrics-like">sárium, et afflige inimícum. Festina</l><l xml:id="m-b0a56347-79b3-4237-a891-9dc76040f63f" facs="#m-439791e6-7080-4148-8118-47bc65232d42" label="lyrics-like">bis lucem miseratiónum tuárum</l><l xml:id="m-7e317a3c-b497-45a2-b70e-bb43e3516107" facs="#m-a4744c84-c7fd-4622-ac5b-22691392beac" label="lyrics-like">tempus, et meménto finis, ut enár¬</l><l xml:id="m-d828a67a-7672-442f-8101-08e7699d7ae6" facs="#m-36184ed7-0236-4703-acb5-3eab9ad3a0c2" label="lyrics-like">et immitte timórem tuum super</l><l xml:id="m-000addc5-0f79-419f-a043-208a57a69c4f" facs="#m-b2cbf029-85aa-47b5-bea7-814f195180f5" label="lyrics-like">rent mirabilia tua. Da testimónium</l><l xml:id="m-98d5efcc-3537-4b37-b604-d6f67f7ddf61" facs="#m-39ee97d5-878d-4680-b8b8-225dd2612e8c" label="lyrics-like">gentes, quae non exquisiérunt te,</l><l xml:id="m-2038c620-1f03-47ea-b94f-5797db43d5bf" facs="#m-7a6ddc53-77f0-41a6-9950-bddf13905c89" label="lyrics-like">his, qui ab initio creatúrae tuae</l><l xml:id="m-685f2cac-3c0b-4c34-892b-78cdf5abc9ff" facs="#m-94b4c507-6080-48e0-a06d-ed753fa92c11" label="lyrics-like">ut cognóscant quia non est Deus</l><l xml:id="m-621bca60-9472-400b-b55e-fef3cdc9bf38" facs="#m-6fa15ed5-274a-43b9-a1bf-95f2cddcbd2d" label="lyrics-like">nisi tu, et enárrent magnália tua.</l><l xml:id="m-db9a5b48-7a01-44f1-94fa-a321146ed316" facs="#m-952b432d-4b22-42ee-97b1-7cd896dbf3f6" label="lyrics-like">sunt, et súscita praedicatiónes, quas</l><l xml:id="m-3fa5fc2e-702c-4102-acf3-630318fdb025" facs="#m-8816273e-c641-410d-8edd-f89d7b733c6b" label="lyrics-like">locúti sunt in nómine tuo prophétae</l><l xml:id="m-d54b9cdd-75ed-433c-9dba-fe7af2e7da97" facs="#m-837ccb30-01dd-4d8e-b871-6a7d381a05a0" label="ambiguous">Alleva manum tuam super gentes</l><l xml:id="m-8bb624e0-65c4-414a-8197-c57d43de0df3" facs="#m-eb5e927f-a706-4608-9d07-7d460e780e6b" label="lyrics-like">aliénas, ut videant poténtiam tuam.</l><l xml:id="m-2e2f1d29-987e-4373-944e-cbc8fed5f082" facs="#m-07c13277-3370-4162-9beb-96bd0d8183db" label="lyrics-like">prióres. Da mercédem sustinéntibus</l><l xml:id="m-cc21a24a-02c2-4409-b9a3-b5d98c251355" facs="#m-00209d70-3876-4c9d-a1ad-c31a331796eb" label="lyrics-like">te, ut prophétae tui fidéles inve¬</l><l xml:id="m-930cbbb5-d6f2-4d19-b1b1-62ff36f46a60" facs="#m-be48db78-8a88-4bee-b4ef-0d96f318e713" label="lyrics-like">Sicut enim in conspéctu eórum san¬</l><l xml:id="m-73728b1c-0ffc-4705-8be1-3cbd9da33746" facs="#m-638e5f5c-b351-4cbd-b5b7-8a8f0fb22054" label="lyrics-like">ctificátus es in nobis, sic in conspé¬</l><l xml:id="m-41020ee9-5aec-45dd-a7f4-2b39684b8e7c" facs="#m-ae96d1ad-9dd8-482d-a2d0-3849bfe0775f" label="lyrics-like">niántur : et exáudi oratiónes servó¬</l><l xml:id="m-31f987fc-b860-41d6-a63c-840b4132dd7c" facs="#m-bf342c07-b6a4-4873-ad27-bae2aa64d9fa" label="lyrics-like">rum tuórum, secúndum benedictió¬</l><l xml:id="m-ff892b11-ffef-4618-b8c1-075e753229d1" facs="#m-0212da3c-5798-483b-abf5-fb18338c7262" label="lyrics-like">ctu nostro magnificáberis in eis, ut</l><l xml:id="m-0878838c-5b8d-44c6-9563-ea91b19598b9" facs="#m-56c320fa-882c-4a3a-92c7-b962750d5fa4" label="lyrics-like">nem Aaron de pópulo tuo, et díri¬</l><l xml:id="m-bb7f1fc3-56e0-4796-886e-7167e23cbc41" facs="#m-5d91aa8c-7477-4cee-a96a-a9e1fa5cb64f" label="lyrics-like">cognóscant te, sicut et nos cognó¬</l><l xml:id="m-ac7fd64d-e8f4-4a46-b5ef-0d9850806339" facs="#m-91ae27f4-5160-454e-8a22-0f5217ada310" label="ambiguous">ge nos in viam justitiae, et sciant</l><l xml:id="m-c0c9a2b4-e575-43f2-92de-c2d38c4ef346" facs="#m-e2c04c5a-42c2-46b7-920d-9e16eccc0e91" label="lyrics-like">vimus, quóniam non est Deus prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-be9e1b6b-0c4a-445f-bf47-7cc0a631e034" facs="#m-39059837-b055-41e8-a525-71dfefba9384" label="lyrics-like">omnes, qui hábitant terram, quia</l><l xml:id="m-88a27cbe-2dfd-4d23-ba15-2ccc0fe88989" facs="#m-d5e49c01-4faa-466e-adc8-4c17173c226e" label="lyrics-like">ter te. Dómine. Innova signa, et</l><l xml:id="m-4c3f5a4f-a7c3-443e-914e-e5b026053013" facs="#m-61cacec3-f694-49cb-a801-71170fc44c86" label="lyrics-like">immúta mirabilia. Glorifica manum tu es Deus conspéctor saeculórum.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>